1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
I wanted us to move as one.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
You arrive half a beat late.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Trying harder, hearing less.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Let my own beat soften.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Your little steps have a song.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
My hands answer softly.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Your turn, then mine.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Different steps make a dance.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Leave a little room for each other.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
When we listen, we belong.
